  MC("A **perfunctory** inspection is…", ["thorough", "done carelessly as a routine", "illegal", "expensive"], 1, "Minimum effort."),
  TXT("One word: \"to make unclear on purpose\" (starts with *o*).", ["obfuscate"], "**Obfuscate**: to darken."),
